			"baseLayerID": -1,
			"baseLayerMD5": "f8422e1f69a7a07b0b72c20d3270d4f2.png",
			"bitmapResolution": 1,
			"rotationCenterX": 240,
			"rotationCenterY": 180,
			"text": "The neigbors are going to give you an interveiw! You nervous for the questions?\r\r1. Nope. I'm prepared\r2. A little, I might make a mistake\r3. A lot! I don't want to embarass myself.",
			"textRect": [0, 0, 482, 210],
			"textColor": -16777216,
			"fontName": "Helvetica Bold",
			"fontSize": 24,
			"textLayerID": -1,
			"textLayerMD5": "c54778de9f2106a68be95a19998df98e.png"
		},
		{
			"costumeName": "background5",
			"baseLayerID": -1,
			"baseLayerMD5": "f8422e1f69a7a07b0b72c20d3270d4f2.png",
			"bitmapResolution": 1,
			"rotationCenterX": 240,
			"rotationCenterY": 180,
			"text": "You seem to be doing pretty well at the interview. The neigbors ask you why yu think you're qualified. You say:\r\r1. \"I'm fun, and love to entertain kids!\"\r2. \"I'm smart, and can deal with lots of unpredictable situations.\"\r3. \"I've had previous experience, and enjoy helping you and talking to the kids.\"",
			"textRect": [0, 0, 479, 297],
			"textColor": -16777216,
			"fontName": "Helvetica Bold",
			"fontSize": 24,
			"textLayerID": -1,
			"textLayerMD5": "5aad3c2f65d0aca0071ffeeee6116886.png"
		},
		{
			"costumeName": "background6",
			"baseLayerID": -1,
			"baseLayerMD5": "f8422e1f69a7a07b0b72c20d3270d4f2.png",
			"bitmapResolution": 1,
			"rotationCenterX": 240,
			"rotationCenterY": 180,
			"text": "You're on for the job! It's from 6:00PM-1:00AM. You have to bring some stuff! What are you going to bring?\r\r1. Toys, or balloons, or dress-up clothes\r2. Basket, Soccer, or Base ball\r3. Books or crafts",
			"textRect": [0, 0, 484, 210],
			"textColor": -16777216,
			"fontName": "Helvetica Bold",
			"fontSize": 24,
			"textLayerID": -1,
			"textLayerMD5": "e12369d2d5e6149f93857bb97f4f4e32.png"
		},
		{
			"costumeName": "background7",
			"baseLayerID": -1,
			"baseLayerMD5": "f8422e1f69a7a07b0b72c20d3270d4f2.png",
			"bitmapResolution": 1,
			"rotationCenterX": 240,
			"rotationCenterY": 180,
			"text": "When you arrive, you have to cook dinner for the kids! They want mac&cheese rather than the brocoli soup their mom has made them, you...\r\r1. Give the kids the soup.\r2. Give them some soup, and a side of the mac&cheese\r3. Give them mac&cheese",
			"textRect": [0, 0, 496, 268],
			"textColor": -16777216,
			"fontName": "Helvetica Bold",
			"fontSize": 24,
			"textLayerID": -1,
			"textLayerMD5": "56b4f1b718cd6d5fff7f70b48e976213.png"
		},
		{
			"costumeName": "background8",
			"baseLayerID": -1,
			"baseLayerMD5": "f8422e1f69a7a07b0b72c20d3270d4f2.png",
			"bitmapResolution": 1,
			"rotationCenterX": 240,
			"rotationCenterY": 180,
			"text": "One of the kid starts to throw his milk at the other kid you...\r\r1. Yell at them to stop\r2. Take the milk away\r3. Put the kid in the naughty corner",
			"textRect": [0, 0, 484, 181],
			"textColor": -16777216,
			"fontName": "Helvetica Bold",
			"fontSize": 24,
			"textLayerID": -1,
			"textLayerMD5": "0408150188e163d8ae81d5f5b0f1a9bf.png"
		},
		{
			"costumeName": "background9",
			"baseLayerID": -1,
			"baseLayerMD5": "f8422e1f69a7a07b0b72c20d3270d4f2.png",
			"bitmapResolution": 1,
			"rotationCenterX": 240,
			"rotationCenterY": 180,
			"text": "The kid stops, and it's time for some fun! The kids want to watch a movie! You let them watch:\r\r1. The powerpuff girls\r2. Cheetahs in the wild\r3. Some baseball movie",
			"textRect": [0, 0, 494, 210],
			"textColor": -16777216,
			"fontName": "Helvetica Bold",
			"fontSize": 24,
			"textLayerID": -1,
			"textLayerMD5": "9ac967a0eb92b454cd5ce99e2c510d82.png"
		},
		{
			"costumeName": "background10",
			"baseLayerID": -1,
			"baseLayerMD5": "f8422e1f69a7a07b0b72c20d3270d4f2.png",
			"bitmapResolution": 1,
			"rotationCenterX": 240,
			"rotationCenterY": 180,
			"text": "The kids beg to play hide and go seek with you! How much are you up for?\r\r1. A few rounds, but you're tired so it's time for bed.\r2. A good amount, you don't want to disapoint the kids.\r3. As many as you can get before 9:00PM, their bedtime. You love games!",
			"textRect": [0, 0, 468, 268],
			"textColor": -16777216,
			"fontName": "Helvetica Bold",
			"fontSize": 24,
			"textLayerID": -1,
			"textLayerMD5": "d7b02622e1551170fdf060680324ab3e.png"
		},
		{
			"costumeName": "background11",
			"baseLayerID": -1,
			"baseLayerMD5": "f8422e1f69a7a07b0b72c20d3270d4f2.png",
			"bitmapResolution": 1,
			"rotationCenterX": 240,
			"rotationCenterY": 180,
			"text": "It's bedtime, finialy. The kids are kind of restless! What's the best way to put them to sleep?\r\r1. Read them one of your favorite stories\r2. Tell them a tale of one of your own adventures\r3. Sing them a soothing lulaby",
			"textRect": [0, 0, 495, 239],
			"textColor": -16777216,
			"fontName": "Helvetica Bold",
			"fontSize": 24,
			"textLayerID": -1,
			"textLayerMD5": "918ae9e06024ddc91849bcde04c4d8e0.png"
		},
		{
			"costumeName": "background12",
			"baseLayerID": -1,
			"baseLayerMD5": "f8422e1f69a7a07b0b72c20d3270d4f2.png",
			"bitmapResolution": 1,
			"rotationCenterX": 240,
			"rotationCenterY": 180,
			"text": "The kids are in bed. You're pretty tired, but you have some homework left. You:\r1. Get all the homework done before sleeping on the couch. You have to finish it!\r2. Get as much of the homework done before you get to tired. Sleep is important.\r3. Go straight to sleep. Homework can wait!",
			"textRect": [0, 0, 469, 297],
			"textColor": -16777216,
			"fontName": "Helvetica Bold",
			"fontSize": 24,
			"textLayerID": -1,
			"textLayerMD5": "9be0bf6f253bb1fe90f07e53f0a25125.png"
		},
		{
			"costumeName": "background13",
			"baseLayerID": -1,
			"baseLayerMD5": "f8422e1f69a7a07b0b72c20d3270d4f2.png",
			"bitmapResolution": 1,
			"rotationCenterX": 240,
			"rotationCenterY": 180,
			"text": "The parents arive a little later than planned. They appologize, and give you a tip. You:\r\r1. Refuse the tip, you don't need it.\r2. Refuse it, but when they insist, take it.\r3. Take it with no questions.",
			"textRect": [0, 0, 483, 210],
			"textColor": -16777216,
			"fontName": "Helvetica Bold",
			"fontSize": 24,
			"textLayerID": -1,
			"textLayerMD5": "b3f06aaca56b5ec8ff2f99e9d4114696.png"
		},
		{
			"costumeName": "background14",
			"baseLayerID": -1,
			"baseLayerMD5": "f8422e1f69a7a07b0b72c20d3270d4f2.png",
			"bitmapResolution": 1,
			"rotationCenterX": 240,
			"rotationCenterY": 180,
			"text": "You arrive home and go straight to sleep. Your favorite part of the day was:\r\r1. Hide and seek\r2. The movie\r3. Bedtime stories\/lulabies",
			"textRect": [0, 0, 496, 181],
			"textColor": -16777216,
			"fontName": "Helvetica Bold",
			"fontSize": 24,
			"textLayerID": -1,
			"textLayerMD5": "9e8da625f3623703abab70ba016af6c5.png"
		},
		{
			"costumeName": "background15",
			"baseLayerID": -1,
			"baseLayerMD5": "f8422e1f69a7a07b0b72c20d3270d4f2.png",
			"bitmapResolution": 1,
			"rotationCenterX": 240,
			"rotationCenterY": 180,
			"text": "\r\r\rTie! You tied with two ponies! See the numbers in the top of the screen? Those are the only numbers you're allowed to choose from on this list! Otherwise, it will not work.\r\rIf you went again, what else would you do with the kids?\r\r1. Have a sports contest\r2. Do a craft\r3. Bake cupcakes or something\r4. Play dressup\r5. Read them another amazing story!\r6. Play some tag",
			"textRect": [0, 0, 466, 247],
			"textColor": -16777216,
			"fontName": "Helvetica Bold",
			"fontSize": 14,
			"textLayerID": -1,
			"textLayerMD5": "611fa9827335266d8f75f962794e7f61.png"
		},
		{
			"costumeName": "aj",
			"baseLayerID": -1,
			"baseLayerMD5": "4a13e6f1e10040c6792e1463f7b17073.jpg",
			"bitmapResolution": 1,
			"rotationCenterX": 240,
			"rotationCenterY": 180,
			"text": "Apple Jack!!!\r\rYou are Applejack. Strong, \rsporty, and overall sweet. \rYou are honest and loyal.\rYou enjoy helping people! You always act as if you know whats going on, and try to solve problems in good ways where no one looses.",
			"textRect": [0, 0, 475, 268],
			"textColor": -16777216,
			"fontName": "Helvetica Bold",
			"fontSize": 24,
			"textLayerID": -1,
			"textLayerMD5": "a7e3a77a8ad8cd47afa6fe42e024859d.png"
		},
		{
			"costumeName": "fs",
			"baseLayerID": -1,
			"baseLayerMD5": "dae46880b82ae99f29c34882b6bbedbb.jpg",
			"bitmapResolution": 1,
			"rotationCenterX": 240,
			"rotationCenterY": 180,
			"text": "Fluttershy\r\rYou are \rfluttershy! \rSweet, quiet,\rand sometimes\rquite a pushover, you enjoy calm activities where you can be yourself. You become easily nervous, and sometimes would rather surround yourself with animals rather than people.",
			"textRect": [0, 0, 492, 326],
			"textColor": -16777216,
			"fontName": "Helvetica Bold",
			"fontSize": 24,
			"textLayerID": -1,
			"textLayerMD5": "c7a896e61927d706e324a94b44309974.png"
		},
		{
			"costumeName": "pp",
			"baseLayerID": -1,
			"baseLayerMD5": "9e0974dc4b18f1d3f1f1f832bf85642b.png",
			"bitmapResolution": 1,
			"rotationCenterX": 240,
			"rotationCenterY": 180,
			"text": "Pinkie Pie\r\rYou are fun, entergetic\rand overall happy!\rYour positive\rattitude makes people\reverywhere very happy.\rYou never sweat the small stuff. Many\rpeople beleive that you have little regard for \"real-life\" problems, but the truth is you hide your common sense and \"normalness\"",
			"textRect": [0, 0, 490, 355],
			"textColor": -16760577,
			"fontName": "Helvetica Bold",
			"fontSize": 24,
			"textLayerID": -1,
			"textLayerMD5": "0fea2f244c2904d64f5510216fd98810.png"
		},
		{
