			"baseLayerID": -1,
			"baseLayerMD5": "7751a9234d74809bcdcef31fd29aab41.jpg",
			"bitmapResolution": 1,
			"rotationCenterX": 240,
			"rotationCenterY": 180,
			"text": "You are Rarity!\r\rVery polite and\rdedicated, you are \rpassonate and straight\rforward.You never let\ranything unwanted fly by you, and will quickly punish the bad. You are a generous friend, any you would love to play dressup with kids!",
